description:
Offices for rent in Bahrain NBB Tower 

Prime Offices for Rent in Brand New Building

Become one of the very first Tenants at the newly development NBB, Bahrain Financial Harbour. The building offers stunning views of Bahrain Bay & Manama, as well as being home to the 5 Star Conrad Bahrain.

By being a Tenant at NBB Tower you will benefit from;

• A prestigious address and landmark location;

• Grade A specifications;

• Five star hotel operator, offering special discounts for NBB Tower office tenants;

• NBB Tower has just received its Gold LEED certification, meaning its sustainable design and operation meet exceptional standards. LEED Building offers a foundation for green buildings that are cost-effective, efficient, and beneficial for health;

contact and what's-app number is: Mohammad Aamir - 38038006
email: Muhammad.mansha@grnata.com
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
We have other types of properties in various locations in the Kingdom of Bahrain.
We also have a property management department which manages more then 1,500 properties along with a maintenance department that can enhance our management and clients requests.





• Floor plates ranging from 975sqm - 1404sqm;
